{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43542","headline":"一字至九字诗联句 · 严维","name":"一字至九字诗联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东，西。\n步月，寻溪。\n鸟已宿，猨又啼。\n狂流碍石，迸笋穿磎。\n望望人烟远，行行萝径迷。\n探题只应尽墨，持赠更欲封泥。\n松下流时何岁月，云中幽处屡攀跻。\n乘兴不知山路远近，缘情莫问日过高低。\n静听林下潺潺足湍濑，厌问城中喧喧多鼓鼙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}